					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=637830&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609945643" alt="SoullessSingularity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=637830)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;" >SoullessSingularity</a></span> <span class="odate time_1346691541 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">03 Sep 2012 16:59</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1555151">
									

<blockquote>
<p>SCP-1347 is to be kept in a standard containment storage unit with two (2) different sets of locks<br />
SCP-1347 is a box of dimensions 20.0x20.0x20.0 (cm)</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Please be consistent with numbering.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>including a possible demotion to D-class</p>
</blockquote>
<p>What? It seems a little hamfisted, mate.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It has a preference towards inquiries of philosophical nature than those of scientific.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Wait, how do you know the preference of a box in which you ask questions and it spits out answers? I mean, does it refuse to answer boring scientific questions?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Note: I want all who work on this SCP to discard the belief that we are working with a simple object here. I'm pretty sure there's some sort of an entity behind it; a consciousness that causes the experiments to happen and replies to us through the box. Therefore, do not be alarmed when the reply to your inquiry seems a little informal. In fact, start worrying if it is formal. Generally, we take that as a sign the entity is unhappy with you. - Dr. Thane</p>
</blockquote>
<p>More than a little hamfisted.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>In fact, start worrying if it is formal. Generally, we take that as a sign the entity is unhappy with you.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>As subtle as a bag of bricks to the skull.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Inquiry: How good is Dr. Ashe in bed?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This lolfoundation shit shouldn't even be in here.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>[DATA EXPUNGED]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is&#8230;. kinda&#8230; useless&#8230; I don't see the point of you putting things in here if you're just going to expunge them.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This addendum addresses the most frequent question Dr. Thane faces from personnel who have read on SCP-1347.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Herewego.jpg</p>
<p>Upon reading, it doesn't add anything to the article because anyone who knows about the foundation enough to be reading the articles should already know this.</p>
<p>Overall: Meh.</p>

